    "html": "<p>Two black body radiators, P and Q, have the surface temperatures and surface areas shown in the table below.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Radiator</th><th>Absolute temperature</th><th>Surface area</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>P</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3T\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"A\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Q</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"27A\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the ratio <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\text{total power radiated by P}}{\\text{total power radiated by Q}}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p>9</p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p>3</p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p>1</p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
